{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，何文田站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，觀塘綫整體行車時間預計需要額外10至15分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n港鐵人員正在處理，提醒乘客為行程預留充裕時間。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T01:23:28.956622+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:05:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:03:55.388394+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T01:17:25.030469+00:00","content_hash":"38559faafe6bfd014baad8ea9df472ae93c5f2dd660dc9f09f5e2e5b0467dbd4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}